### Design Pattern:  Ribbon with List

Similar to:
- Segment editor (`lcards-segment-list-editor`) — expandable list items
- Stack card editor — one tab per card with [+ Add Card]
- Rules dashboard — read-only display with visual grouping

**NOT** one-tab-per-datasource (would create too many tabs for cards with many datasources).

